For the next few days Pepper couldn't help but wonder what was behind the door. He was curious and excited to finally find out!

Pepper opened the door and descended into the basement. It looked like a maze down there, but Pepper kept exploring until he found a little room at the end of a long hallway. Inside the room was a fluffy white cat. Pepper was scared at first, but the cat was friendly and offered to show Pepper around the basement.

