        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">Once upon a time, there was a mouse who lived in a hole in the wall. Every day, he would run around the house, looking for food and playing games with his friends.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">One day, a big, black cat came to the house. The mouse was terrified, but he had to be brave. He ran to the corner and hid. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The next day, the mouse was surprised to discover the cat sleeping in his hole. The mouse decided to be brave and said, &quot;Hello Mister Cat! What are you doing here?&quot; <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The cat opened one eye and replied, &quot;I&#039;m here to keep you safe from danger.&quot; <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The mouse was so surprised and touched by the cat&#039;s kindness that he immediately became friends. From then on, the mouse and the cat would play hide-and-seek and have lots of fun together.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The mouse and the cat were the best of friends. And they lived happily ever after!</span>
        \"\"\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">created_by</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7 characters\">agrabic</span>\"
