        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">Once upon a time, in a far-away kingdom, there lived a mouse, a dog, and a cat.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">The mouse was always so small compared to the dog and cat and everyone would often forget about him. Because of this, the little mouse was always very lonely.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">One day, the mouse got very brave and decided to introduce himself to the cat and the dog. The cat and dog were not scared anymore and looked at the mouse with kindness and compassion.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">From then on, the mouse, dog and cat, each day, would take a path in the woods, running and jumping and exploring together. The three of them quickly became inseparable friends and had the best of times in the woods.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">The moral of the story- It doesn&#039;t matter who you are! Everyone deserves a chance to be someone&#039;s friend.</span>
        \"\"\"
