        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">Once upon a time there was a monkey named Max and a cow named Daisy. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">Max and Daisy were great friends, they did everything together. One day, Max and Daisy decided to go for a picnic. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">Max and Daisy packed a basket of goodies and set off towards a beautiful river. They had a lovely time, eating the fruits and vegetables that Max had packed.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">Suddenly, Daisy heard a loud noise coming from the other side of the river. She led Max to the other side to check it out. It was a group of humans cutting down the trees!<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">Max and Daisy were so angry and, to stop them from destroying the trees, Max started throwing fruit at the humans. He kept throwing fruits as fast as he could at the humans, until they ran away, scared.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">Max and Daisy hugged each other and rejoiced for saving the forest. Max and Daisy became even better friends, knowing that they had the strength and courage to protect the animals and the environment.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">THE END</span>
        \"\"\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">created_by</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"13 characters\">anteajeljubav</span>\"
