","results":"<pre class=sf-dump id=sf-dump-2081991909 data-indent-pad=\"  \"><span class=sf-dump-note>Illuminate\\Support\\Collection</span> {<a class=sf-dump-ref>#313</a><samp data-depth=1 class=sf-dump-expanded>
  #<span class=sf-dump-protected title=\"Protected property\">items</span>: <span class=sf-dump-note>array:2</span> [<samp data-depth=2 class=sf-dump-compact>
    <span class=sf-dump-index>0</span> => {<a class=sf-dump-ref>#315</a><samp data-depth=3 class=sf-dump-compact>
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">id</span>\": <span class=sf-dump-num>1</span>
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"22 characters\">Story of mouse and cat</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">text</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">Once upon a time, there was a mouse who lived in a hole in the wall. Every day, he would run around the house, looking for food and playing games with his friends.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">One day, a big, black cat came to the house. The mouse was terrified, but he had to be brave. He ran to the corner and hid. <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The next day, the mouse was surprised to discover the cat sleeping in his hole. The mouse decided to be brave and said, &quot;Hello Mister Cat! What are you doing here?&quot; <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The cat opened one eye and replied, &quot;I&#039;m here to keep you safe from danger.&quot; <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The mouse was so surprised and touched by the cat&#039;s kindness that he immediately became friends. From then on, the mouse and the cat would play hide-and-seek and have lots of fun together.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"811 characters\">The mouse and the cat were the best of friends. And they lived happily ever after!</span>
        \"\"\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">created_by</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7 characters\">agrabic</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">created_at</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"19 characters\">2023-02-26 19:20:27</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">updated_at</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"19 characters\">2023-02-26 19:20:27</span>\"
    </samp>}
    <span class=sf-dump-index>1</span> => {<a class=sf-dump-ref>#319</a><samp data-depth=3 class=sf-dump-compact>
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">id</span>\": <span class=sf-dump-num>3</span>
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">title</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"27 characters\">Story of mouse, dog and cat</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">text</span>\": \"\"\"
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">Once upon a time, in a far-away kingdom, there lived a mouse, a dog, and a cat.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">The mouse was always so small compared to the dog and cat and everyone would often forget about him. Because of this, the little mouse was always very lonely.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">One day, the mouse got very brave and decided to introduce himself to the cat and the dog. The cat and dog were not scared anymore and looked at the mouse with kindness and compassion.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">From then on, the mouse, dog and cat, each day, would take a path in the woods, running and jumping and exploring together. The three of them quickly became inseparable friends and had the best of times in the woods.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
        <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"752 characters\">The moral of the story- It doesn&#039;t matter who you are! Everyone deserves a chance to be someone&#039;s friend.</span>
        \"\"\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">created_by</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"7 characters\">agrabic</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">created_at</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"19 characters\">2023-02-26 19:29:05</span>\"
      +\"<span class=sf-dump-public title=\"Runtime added dynamic property\">updated_at</span>\": \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"19 characters\">2023-02-26 19:29:05</span>\"
    </samp>}
  </samp>]
