      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\">Once upon a time there lived a cute bear and a cuddly bunny. They lived in a small village in the middle of a deep forest.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\">One day, the bear and the bunny decided to go on an adventure. They imagined all sorts of wonderful things they would see, do, and explore in the forest.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
