      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\">One day, the bear and the bunny came to a cave. It looked exciting, so they decided to explore. They crept inside the cave and discovered many interesting things.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\">Suddenly, the bear heard a noise and realized that the cave was already inhabited! A large and furry creature was sleeping quietly at the back of the cave. The bear and the bunny were scared and ran out of the cave as quickly as they could.<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1008 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\n</span></span>
